{"id":"SNIP_Can_AUTOSAR_SWS_CANI_P172_691","src":"snippet","doc":"AUTOSAR_SWS_CANInterface","page":172,"text":"This parameter defines the name of the <User_TxConfirmation>. This\nparameter depends on the parameter\nCanIfTxPduUserTxConfirmationUL. If\nCanIfTxPduUserTxConfirmationUL equals CAN_TP, CAN_NM, PDUR,\nXCP, CAN_TSYN, J1939NM or J1939TP, the name of the\n<User_TxConfirmation> is fixed. If CanIfTxPduUserTxConfirmationUL\nequals CDD, the name of the <User_TxConfirmation> is selectable.","caption":"","sha":null,"series":[],"releases":[],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.9,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"CanIfTxPduUserTxConfirmationName configuration requirement","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00542"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.85,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"TxConfirmation name for PDUR","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00439"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.85,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"TxConfirmation name for CAN_NM","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00543"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.85,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"TxConfirmation name for J1939TP","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00544"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.85,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"TxConfirmation name for CAN_TP","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00550"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.85,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"TxConfirmation name for CDD","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00551"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.85,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"TxConfirmation name for XCP","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00556"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.85,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"TxConfirmation name for J1939NM","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00858"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.85,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"TxConfirmation name for CAN_TSYN","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00879"}],"ok":true,"schema":"versions-explorer@1"}